[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11640.55, "timestamp": "03:14:00", "text": "像这样的餐厅，还是像这样的？大厅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11642.229, "timestamp": "03:14:02", "text": "我们现在所站的大厅。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11644.59, "timestamp": "03:14:04", "text": "好吧，我把它放在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11647.03, "timestamp": "03:14:07", "text": "矿。我在开玩笑。我在开玩笑。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11649.59, "timestamp": "03:14:09", "text": "我要……好吧，你们等等……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.309, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "医疗包。我来拿汽油桶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11654.269, "timestamp": "03:14:14", "text": "并且喜欢让他们保持这种状态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.389, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "边。是的。是的。呃，辞职吧。在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11662.229, "timestamp": "03:14:22", "text": "你是？我已经到前门了。 E."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11668.469, "timestamp": "03:14:28", "text": "好的，先生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11673.03, "timestamp": "03:14:33", "text": "请看这个。哦，是的。按E键。好的。现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11675.469, "timestamp": "03:14:35", "text": "按 R 键。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11678.79, "timestamp": "03:14:38", "text": "R：哦，为了火炬。你需要电池"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11680.63, "timestamp": "03:14:40", "text": "给火炬用。为什么？你不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11682.87, "timestamp": "03:14:42", "text": "电池，但会增加数量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.19, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "呃，你拥有的紫外线。哦，我得到了一个南瓜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11689.75, "timestamp": "03:14:49", "text": "哦，我们已经遇到恶魔了。经过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.349, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "路上要小心。是啊，那些恶魔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11693.91, "timestamp": "03:14:53", "text": "随时生成。如果你看到一份恶魔职业，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11698.07, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "text": "按下鼠标右键并按住鼠标右键。"}]